    "TrackGraph": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Spårgraf: what CAD sends to Studio (CAD-10). Ids are never changed when the module is\nredrawn, and never used again for something else (CAD-20). geometry is \"mm\" for a module's\nreal geometry; a drawing read by the photo chain for Studio gives \"schema\" (bildkedjan, 21),\nin the drawing's own coordinates with y down, with its labels and its symbols, and line exits\nand buffer stops at the tracks' ends. The same format goes both ways to Studio.\ncomplete is false while the tracks between the gables are unknown: a module from measures\nwhose gables differ waits for its photo or its drawing.",
      "properties": {
        "geometry": {
          "default": "mm",
          "enum": [
            "mm",
            "schema"
          ],
